<title>USA: DTE Energy Co Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>DTE Energy Co Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.54		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			 77,670		   74,267</p>
<p> Revs		     887,116		  867,026</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 145,120		  145,120</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995 included a $32 million after-tax write-off, or $0.22 a share, of steam heating plant assets. Operating income was $154.258 million versus $154.330 million.  </p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.13		    $2.80</p>
<p> Net			309,296		  405,914</p>
<p> Revs		   3,654,400		3,635,544</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 145,120		  144,940</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The 1996 12-month period includes a special after-tax charge of $97 million or $0.67 a share for steam heating service improvements and retirement of part of the system. The 1995 12-month period also includes the write-off of steam heating plan assets of $32 million after tax or $0.22 a share. Operating income for 1996 was $613.908 million versus $739.322 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
